{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-4","storyName":"雪里蕻","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"煌来到鼎丰楼参加百珍宴的厨师选拔赛，与此同时，惊蛰也来此查案。煌歪打正着地通过了层层选拔，与莫不服会面时，鼎丰楼比赛现场却突然起火。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["礼貌的招待","煌","行箸","严厉的考官","悠闲的厨师","无聊的厨师","麟青砚","鼎丰楼厨师","？？？","莫不服","左乐","窘迫的食客"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_bg_58_g15_restaurantlobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":5},{"type":"dialogue","name":"礼貌的招待","text":"欢迎光临鼎丰楼。","id":6},{"type":"dialog","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gateopen","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_dailylifeofbaizao_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":13,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"哇......这就是传说中的鼎丰楼。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"你......还紧张吗？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"嗯？有什么好紧张的。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"马上就要比赛了，可为什么，我有种心虚的感觉......","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"毕竟......","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"怕什么，小大厨最后都说可以了。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"再说了，我们又不是真的去当厨子的，我们只是想找到那位传奇大厨，亲口问问他那种桔红酥的做法。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"事到如今，也只能这么说服自己了......","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":33},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"时间差不多了。观赛的客官请在这里留步，参赛的厨师请随我上前。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"遇到难题的时候，千万别冲动，冷静思考，总有办法的......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"放心吧，我去啦。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"charslot","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"请坐。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"虽说您今天是来参加考试的，但远来是客，还请先用一杯茶。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$pourwater","id":53},{"type":"text","text":"考官端起桌上的茶壶，为煌倒上茶水，清甜的香味顿时盈满鼻腔。","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"说是比赛，这氛围还挺友好的嘛......","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"正好路上口渴，多谢啦！","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","id":59},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"煌拿起茶盏，仰头满饮。","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"紧接着，考官将纸笔放在她的面前。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"这壶茶中泡了几味料，写下来。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":66},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":67},{"type":"multiline","name":"煌","text":"噗——","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":69},{"type":"multiline","name":"煌","text":"咳咳咳咳......啥？！","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"煌看向自己的茶盏，仅剩的一点水珠挂在杯壁上。煌又抬起头看向了眼前的考官，他的脸上依然挂着一副礼貌的微笑。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我还能......再来一杯吗？","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":78},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_bg_58_g10_restaurantkitchen.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":79},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1636_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的厨师","text":"我估计今天应该是没戏咯，从上午到现在来了几十号人，到现在这第一关都没人能过。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1636_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无聊的厨师","text":"总厨出题也太刁钻了，考试的人一进门就是这样一出，换谁来都会蒙啊。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1636_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的厨师","text":"舌头就是厨师的眼睛，要是舌头上的功夫不过关，厨艺也高不到哪里去。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的厨师","text":"连这一关都过不了，那也不用浪费总厨时间了，还是叫他们早些打道回府的好。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":93},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":94},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的厨师","text":"哎哎客人，这里可是后厨。你怎么——","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"charslot","id":100},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"大理寺查案，烦请各位配合。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":109},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_bg_58_g15_restaurantlobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":110},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":111},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":112,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"冷静......冷静......","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"Mechanist说过，人的舌头只能尝出四种味道，但是鼻子可以分辨出上百种味道......","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"虽然我也没有从他的“机油”酒中闻出过什么味就是了......","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":116},{"type":"text","text":"煌小心翼翼地端起已经没那么烫的茶盏，仔细嗅闻着杯中余味。","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"能闻到花香，应该是茉莉花的味道......","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"不，不止是茉莉花，还有一种......对，是菊花！小大厨饭馆里待客的菊花茶就是这种味道！","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"除了花香，茶水喝下去的时候，我记得明明有一点酸甜味......","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"前面的料都不带酸，那最后的那点味道到底是什么......","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这个酸酸甜甜的味道，好像有点熟悉？","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":126},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","id":130},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_bg_58_g2_downtownarea.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"为什么要带我来喝这个梅子酒？","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这梅子酒，其实也算百灶的一样特色。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"在百灶城北方，有一大片梅林。每年六月初夏，新鲜的梅子成熟的时候，人们会采下许多拿来泡酒，最好是用小寒酒来泡。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"嗯......这种苔麦酿成的酒，有种特殊的香味，搭配梅子正好。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"泡制三个月左右的时间，到中秋就刚好能喝了。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"梅子酒......也有什么历史吗？","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"你刚才不是问我......那些百灶建城时牺牲的人，后来都怎样了吗？","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"其实也算不上什么历史，我只是想起，在过去条件艰苦的时候，梅干是工人们常吃的一种食物。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"在百灶城建好后，不知哪一年起，城北的山上，就有了这样一片梅林。不知是何时，也不知是谁种下的。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这也算是......一种纪念？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"至少，他们从来没有被忘记......","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"嗯，等明年梅子熟的时候，我可以带你去山上看看。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":154},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":155},{"type":"charslot","id":156},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_bg_58_g15_restaurantlobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"......这是我的答案。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"茉莉花，野菊，青梅，天岳春，冰糖......小寒酒？","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我听说，百灶的北面有片梅林。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"六月采的梅子做酒，酿到中秋刚好。这里用的梅子应该是早前采的，所以酸涩味还没完全去掉。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"酒气在煮茶时消散，所以只剩下梅子的酸甜口感，再加上使用的花朵本身温和的口感和淡香......","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"虽然刚入口时并不明显，但回味让人印象深刻......还想再来一杯！","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"能尝出前几味材料应该是情理之中，但是能尝出这是用了小寒酒的，你还是今天头一个。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我......说对了？","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"你难道对自己给出的答案不自信？","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#7$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"没！没有！当然不是......哈哈......","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"那恭喜你通过第一关。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"请随我上楼。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_beatgong","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gateopen","delay":"1","channel":"2","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"后堂传来一声击锣声，煌身旁的大门缓缓打开。","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"第一关......？还有几关啊......","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":188},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":193},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_bg_58_g10_restaurantkitchen.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":196},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":197,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1636_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":199},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鼎丰楼厨师","text":"大人......这是您要的，鼎丰楼厨师的名录。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1636_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鼎丰楼厨师","text":"能不能麻烦问问，您到底是来查什么的......？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1636_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......大理寺重要密案，暂时不方便告知。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鼎丰楼厨师","text":"呃......","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1636_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这里的总厨，名字叫莫不服？","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鼎丰楼厨师","text":"当然，莫大厨的名号，整个百灶厨界谁人不知？","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1636_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你知不知道，在来到鼎丰楼以前，莫不服做的是什么工作？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鼎丰楼厨师","text":"这我可就不知道了......莫大厨来鼎丰楼也就不到十年的时间，说长不长说短不短，但他的厨艺确实出神入化，很快就接了老总厨的班。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1636_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"他现在在哪里？我需要见他。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鼎丰楼厨师","text":"实在不好意思，总厨他现在正在主持考试，实在不方便见您。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1636_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"考试？什么考试？","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鼎丰楼厨师","text":"您就当是鼎丰楼的招生考试？好几年才举办一届呢。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1636_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鼎丰楼厨师","text":"您要是感兴趣的话，这里也能看到转播哦！","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1636_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"all","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这参赛的人......","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"煌......？","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":232},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"charslot","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":236},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_bg_25_g11_yanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":239},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act40side/m_sys_act40side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":240,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这里是......","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这里不是酒楼吗......为什么这个房间好像书房？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"鼎丰楼数百年历史，接待过无数名士大家，鼎丰楼特意留了这样一间书房，来保存他们的墨宝。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"珍馐书画，都是瑰宝，都见功夫。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":247},{"type":"text","text":"煌仰头望去，房顶垂下千百根丝线，每根丝线都系着一块木牌，似一张帷幕。","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这上面写的，都是菜名......","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"你应该知道，鼎丰楼如今招纳厨师，是为了百珍宴做准备。这要求厨师不只有厨艺，也得了解自己做的菜品的意义。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"挂在这里的，都是历届百珍宴上有来头的菜品。你抽一块木牌，说出这道菜的来历，便是今天的第二关。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"（百珍宴的菜？我哪知道？！）","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"（都到这一步了——）","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodensign","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":259},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"3","id":260},{"type":"text","text":"煌闭上眼睛，猛地抽下一块木牌。临近的木牌互相牵动，发出连绵的碰撞声。","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这是什么......","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"“天下一白”？","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","id":268},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_bg_58_g15_restaurantlobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐基本没有什么做菜的知识，能闯过第一关已经是侥幸。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"她从小在维多利亚长大，怎么可能知道这些故事......","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐......这我可帮不了你呀......","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":277},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_bg_25_g11_yanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的考官","text":"时间有限。这道菜的出处，你知道吗？","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"......","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"大概五十年前，炎国的太师给真龙献上了一道菜，是一道再简单不过的清炖萝卜。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"但特殊之处在于，这道菜用到的萝卜来自天南地北，本身的味道口感相差巨大。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"但是萝卜经过长时间炖煮，吸足了汤汁，吃到嘴里，都是一样好吃。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我听说，炎国向来十分重视教育，可炎国太大，各个城市的环境也是天差地别，越是偏远的地区，学生越难有所成。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"那位太师是想告诉真龙，天下学子，不论出身，都该有平等的机会。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"真龙听取了太师的建议，着力支持教育改革，努力打破了办学讲学在地域上的限制，平均教育资源。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"第二年，百灶学宫发榜，录取的一千多人里，偏远地区出身的学子有一半多。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"往后的几十年里，天师府深造的天师、学宫中寒窗苦读的学子，都十分感谢当年太师的直言进谏......","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这应该，就是这道“天下一白”的含义......","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0","fadetime":"3","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"煌话音刚落，她感到观众席的交谈声顿时小了下来。","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"事实上，她的感觉并没有错，所有人都在盯着她，神色紧张。","id":298},{"type":"dialog","id":299},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"charslot","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","id":302},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_bg_58_g15_restaurantlobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"（煌小姐......为什么知道这件事？）","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"（这里的出题人，怎么还会留着这道菜......）","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"（那个人，可不是能当众提起的呀......）","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":312},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_bg_25_g11_yanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我是说错了什么吗......","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"有意思。","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"声音自几丈高之处落下，煌抬头望去，却不见人影。","id":319},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenstairfts","id":320},{"type":"text","text":"脚步踩在楼梯的木板上，发出一阵闷响，它沉稳有力，让人无法忽略。","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"声音越来越近，煌终于勉强能看清来者——严肃的长者从长阶上缓缓走下。","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"3","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"没想到过了这么多年，还有人记得这事。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"您就是......","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#9$1","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"你讲的这个故事，年纪可比你大，姑娘，你是怎么知道的？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这是很久以前，我的家人给我讲过的故事。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"那个人说，他就是当年，那无数寒门学子之一。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#3$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"饮水思源，想来你的家人也是一个重情重义的人。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"可是你......","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"你到底是怀着什么心思来到这里的？","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我......当然是......准备认真参加比赛的......","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"你已经站到了这里，那我就给你一个机会。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"最后一关，堂堂正正地，做一道“菜”。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"跟我来。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":346},{"type":"dialog","id":347},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"charslot","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":350},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_bg_58_g1_yusrestaurant.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"还不到饭点，饭馆里只零星坐着几个客人，却不见跑堂与老板，后厨也是一片寂静。","id":355},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":358,"musicid":4},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"请问......","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窘迫的食客","text":"这位小哥！帮帮忙吧！","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窘迫的食客","text":"今天出门实在着急，忘了带饭钱。这位小哥一看就是大家公子，行行好，借我两个子吧！","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"这......","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窘迫的食客","text":"不白拿你的，喏，这块家传宝玉先抵在你这。等我回头拿了钱再找你赎回它。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"借给您倒也无妨......可是您既然有这样的麻烦，直接和这里的老板说明不就好了吗......？我们素不相识，您又怎么把钱还我？","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窘迫的食客","text":"不一样不一样，这块宝玉可不是凡物，不是交到谁手里都行的。我是见公子气度不凡，这才委托您保管一下的。","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"好......好吧......","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":376},{"type":"text","text":"左乐从口袋里掏出一点零钱交给食客，食客拿到了钱，立刻喜上眉梢。","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"您打算何时把钱还给我......？我们要约在哪见？","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窘迫的食客","text":"有缘则见，无缘就不见。要是无缘，公子拿这块玉典当换钱就行。","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窘迫的食客","text":"放心放心，这笔生意，公子不会亏的。","id":382},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":383},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"4","id":384},{"type":"text","text":"话音未落，食客一溜烟地跑出了饭馆，消失在人群里。","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"典当......换钱？","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":391},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_bg_58_g10_restaurantkitchen.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":396},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这就是我准备的菜，品相不错吧？","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"......长寿面？","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":402},{"type":"text","text":"莫不服的手落在案上，迟迟没有动筷。他沉默了许久，才拿起勺子，尝了一口汤。","id":403},{"type":"text","text":"煌小心地观察着莫大厨，可她期待的那种满意的神情迟迟没有在老人脸上出现。","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#2$1","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"......","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8d/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#5$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"这碗面......这个汤底，是谁教你做的？","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"一个小不点厨子教的，学会怎么做我还花了不少功夫呢......","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#5$1","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"“余味居”的老板，是你什么人？","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你怎么......","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#5$1","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"果然......","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":417},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":418},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bowl_smash","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"......欺人太甚！","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"啊......？","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#5$1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"我看他有些天分，想给他一个机会大展身手。可他不领情也就罢了，现在还要派一个半吊子来羞辱我！","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":425},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":426},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":430},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","id":432},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":433,"musicid":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_bg_58_g15_restaurantlobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":434},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌明明很顺利地完成了......味道按说不会差才对。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"为什么......莫不服，难道认识小大厨？","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":438},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":439},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":440},{"type":"charslot","id":441},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_bg_58_g10_restaurantkitchen.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":442},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":443},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":444},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2.5","id":445},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","duration":"1.5","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"等等！你先等一下！","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"对不起！我知道你肯定一眼就能看出我根本不会做菜，我也不是故意来你的比赛上捣乱的！","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"只是有个问题，我必须向你请教！","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"......","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我从小生活在维多利亚，那时我远在炎国的家人经常会寄一种桔红酥给我。味道很甜，很好吃......","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我来百灶后找了很久，但一直没有找到那种味道......","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我想，你是全百灶最好的厨师，你也许会知道！","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"就是一味点心？这个问题值得你专门参加比赛来找我？","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我还有很多问题！但现在靠我一个人，只能解决这一个。这是我唯一能接触到的与我家人有关的线索了！","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#5$1","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"你......","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"......做桔红酥最忌讳的就是一味加糖，用甜味去掩盖手艺不精和用料不佳。","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"我是不知道谁有那么大的本事，能把桔红酥做得又甜又好吃。","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"你要问的问题问完了，走吧。","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"等等——","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":470},{"type":"charslot","id":471},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":472},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"5","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":473},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenladder","id":474},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":475},{"type":"text","text":"两人的正上方响起沉闷的声音，煌和莫不服抬头看去，脸庞却被什么东西打湿。","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#8$1","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"这里怎么会漏水......","id":478,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"不对......是油！","id":480,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":481},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_kjerag_h_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14side/m_bat_kjerag_h_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":482,"musicid":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","id":483},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"1","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"false","id":484},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"1","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":485},{"type":"text","text":"话音刚落，穹顶悬挂的吊灯瞬间燃起，化成一个火球——","id":486},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"35","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":487},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"快躲开！","id":489,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":490},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":491},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":492},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":493},{"type":"image","id":494},{"type":"charslot","id":495}],"characters":["礼貌的招待","煌","行箸","严厉的考官","悠闲的厨师","无聊的厨师","麟青砚","鼎丰楼厨师","？？？","莫不服","左乐","窘迫的食客"]}